               <msContents>
                  <summary/>
                  
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                     <locus from="3ra" to="149rb"/>
                     <title type="complete" xml:lang="gez" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1948Mashaf">Maṣḥafa Mār Yǝṣhāq</title>
                     <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                     <note>The text contains 34 ‘paragraphs’ (<foreign xml:lang="gez">አንቀጽ</foreign>) with numbers indicated by
                        numerals (e.g., ፳, ፴ወ፪) or written out (<foreign xml:lang="gez">ቀዳማዊ</foreign>, <foreign xml:lang="gez">ራብዕ</foreign>); there are also other text sections:
                        discourses (<foreign xml:lang="gez">ነገር</foreign>, <locus target="#46ra #54rb #56vb"/>), chapters
                        (<foreign xml:lang="gez">ምዕራፍ</foreign>, <locus target="#69rb #101rb #107va"/>), prayers (<foreign xml:lang="gez">ጸሎት</foreign>, <locus target="#87va #92rb #111vb"/>) 
                        and the concluding homily  (<foreign xml:lang="gez">ድርሳን</foreign>, <locus target="#145ra"/>).</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
